<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating for Unocal Corp to buy from hold, a source at Prudential said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Unocal's stock closed at 40-3/4 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
